Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:09:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 209/260] [ae-patch] Switch a Claude chat's login in place and
 keep a chat on the login it started with

A relaunch reads the login the chat last launched on when no pick is stored, so a restart never moves it to the new-chat default. A claude_account_change event restarts the chat's Claude terminal (refused while a reply or approval runs). The composer Account menu gets This chat and New chats groups, a changed new-chat login asks whether to move every open chat, and the usage-limit dock switches this chat in place with a separate copy to another login.
